{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/678469-looking-for-a-online-messageboard-distance-hunter-the-vigil-game-or-a-mortals-game","id":678469,"title":"Looking for a online/messageboard/distance Hunter: The Vigil game, or a mortals game.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-25T21:09:53-07:00","id":678469,"title":"Looking for a online/messageboard/distance Hunter: The Vigil game, or a mortals game.","content":"I'm looking for a Hunter: The Vigil game, or maybe a regular World of Darkness game where everyone is a mortal investigator. I have a decent amount of tabletop nWoD experience with the various lines. Last time I did a online game was around a decade ago on the roleplayinggames.net messageboards though, so I'm not sure what the latest and greatest is now for distance games. Messageboards had a nice pace to them for people who were busy, but I'm open to new things.<br /> <br /> Any assistance would be much appreciated, thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/819-vaneheart","name":"Vaneheart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar819_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-26T05:11:39-07:00","id":678895,"title":"","content":"If you can find some other players, I could probably run a game. I'm already running a Changeling game over on a forum and it's doing alright right now. I really like playing mortals games as well, and had to read a bit of Hunter because there is one in the game I've mentioned. I really like forums for WoD games because like you said it helps if everyone is busy and whatnot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-26T22:57:28-07:00","id":679696,"title":"","content":"Alright. Sounds good. How many people would you like me to try and gather?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/819-vaneheart","name":"Vaneheart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar819_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-27T06:07:19-07:00","id":679900,"title":"","content":"I normally like having myself and at least 2-3 other players. Solo games are not my style.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-27T16:27:26-07:00","id":680503,"title":"","content":"I've got at least three to four people who are interested. Could probably snag two more if needed. What's the next move?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/819-vaneheart","name":"Vaneheart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar819_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-27T17:14:52-07:00","id":680533,"title":"","content":"Did you have any preference for what forum you wanted to play on or what? I have one that I'm using now, but I don't want to ask you and your friends to migrate if you're not comfortable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-27T18:02:49-07:00","id":680564,"title":"","content":"No preference really. I think the only stipulation for some of them they mentioned was &quot;not Facebook or Google+&quot; for some reason. At least two of them are kinda new to the &quot;play by messageboard&quot; system, but all of them have experience with World of Darkness.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Huh. <a href=\"http://www.roleplayinggames.net/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.roleplayinggames.net/</a> is still around. Was a pretty good board for RPGs with a built-in dice rolling system and some good templates. I'm surprised it still exists though, been around forever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":819,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/819-vaneheart","user":"Vaneheart","date":". 09-28-2015, 12:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/819-vaneheart","name":"Vaneheart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar819_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-27T18:49:51-07:00","id":680578,"title":"","content":"For Hunter, I was thinking only tier one fresh Hunters. If you want to do or prefer vanilla WoD instead, was also thinking newbie mortals. Whether or not we know eachother ahead of time is totally up to you of course.<br /> <br /> Are you using the updated GMC and H:TV - Mortal Remains rules? Is there anything you would like players to stay away from (psychics/kinetics, low-magic, hedge witchcraft, minor/moral Slashers, etc)?<br /> <br /> Generally these guys tend to play some of the most boringly normal people ever, but you never know. :-)<br /> <br /> Last time I ran a game for them, we had the following characters:<br /> -Geologist College Professor<br /> -Law Office Intern<br /> -Real Estate Broker<br /> -Automechanic<br /> -Long Haul Trucker<br /> <br /> Rare Oddballs Were:<br /> -Minor T.V. celebrity actor that was the star of a &quot;Ghost Hunting&quot; show (obviously fake).<br /> -Shady antiques dealer<br /> -Professional Car Jacker (Criminal)<br /> -Rich dilettante oil money heir (but not too important, like the seventh son or something) from the United Arab Emirates.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":819,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/819-vaneheart","user":"Vaneheart","date":". 09-28-2015, 04:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/819-vaneheart","name":"Vaneheart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar819_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T06:13:20-07:00","id":680952,"title":"","content":"All Good Questions<br /> 1.I'm currently using a board called RPNation, it has great formatting and a dice roller as well.If you'd rather use something else, lemme know.<br /> <br /> 2.I'd prefer Tier-One Hunters actually. Mortals also works, or even mortals becoming hunters over time.<br /> <br /> 3.I'd be ok with using Mortal Remains, because I have it and I know the GMC rules now...I just got a bit confused because I'm still new to Hunter. Mortal Remains would be ok though, I can do that.<br /> I read GMC first and only just recently within the last week read Mortal Remains, just so it makes sense.<br /> <br /> 4.I normally allow Psychics and low-magic/gutter-magic, but I've never done Slashers so let's not do that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T17:10:21-07:00","id":681567,"title":"","content":"Awesome. I'll get them started on character creation and concepts and stuff. RPNation looks neat, although I've never messed with it before. Where would the game setting be at Philly? New York?<br /> <br /> What's the next step?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/819-vaneheart","name":"Vaneheart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar819_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T18:07:36-07:00","id":681608,"title":"","content":"Well, my rule is to normally only use places I've visited or use a fictional place.<br /> <br /> I prefer fictional places, but I've been to Las Vegas, Colorado, California, New York, and Arizona mostly. I also live in Florida, so that counts...before I forget.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T18:41:21-07:00","id":681615,"title":"","content":"Hunter normally takes place in Philly, but I'm down for whatever. Colorado, Florida, or Arizona could be a neat change of pace. Whatever is easier for you though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/819-vaneheart","name":"Vaneheart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar819_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T20:35:01-07:00","id":681719,"title":"","content":"The best thing for me would be to use a fictional city unless everyone is against that. Otherwise, those options work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T21:23:56-07:00","id":681736,"title":"","content":"Maybe if it was a small city. I think they could work with a fictional city. Hadn't really considered that. I pointed them in the direction of RPNation so they could get registered and everything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/819-vaneheart","name":"Vaneheart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar819_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T05:11:05-07:00","id":681940,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that sounds awesome to me. Let's do something like that. Make sure to give me the account names so I can contact everyone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T13:00:17-07:00","id":682296,"title":"","content":"My username is NovaPheonix on there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T18:18:16-07:00","id":682525,"title":"","content":"Ok, sounds good. My username is Vaneheart. I'll see about getting everyone rolling on it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/819-vaneheart","name":"Vaneheart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar819_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T21:34:55-07:00","id":682636,"title":"","content":"Awesome, can't wait now!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T23:19:38-07:00","id":682690,"title":"","content":"Well, I can't send any private messages for a bit on RPNation. I'll have to post more first. One of my friends on there is Dwerth. So far for characters we have the following:<br /> <br /> -Aging (mid forties) private insurance investigator with psychometry<br /> -Former New York vice cop turned private security bodyguard who recently returned to the states after an overseas job.<br /> -A financial accountant.<br /> <br /> The other two are still tossing around ideas. I'll PM you their character sheets, at least what they have so far.<br /> <br /> I actually have quite a few additional people who are interested in doing this. What's the maximum number of people you would be comfortable with?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/819-vaneheart","name":"Vaneheart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar819_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T09:27:05-07:00","id":683241,"title":"","content":"Is there anyone who would want to do something in real time? like skype or google hangouts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T11:18:35-07:00","id":683320,"title":"","content":"I don't want to interrupt but there is a chat site that has a very active mortal venue and is looking for STs ax well as players. It is a crossover venue so being a hunter is an option but it does not use Hunter rules at all. I don't want to derail what you have going on here but it's worth looking over if anyone is interested. Maybe I'll see some of you there.<br /> <br /> Edit: <a href=\"http://www.wodgotham.com/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.wodgotham.com/index.php</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8150,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8150-talvas","user":"Talvas","date":". 09-30-2015, 02:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8150-talvas","name":"Talvas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T13:42:04-07:00","id":683487,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vitalis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/678469-looking-for-a-online-messageboard-distance-hunter-the-vigil-game-or-a-mortals-game?p=683241#post683241\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there anyone who would want to do something in real time? like skype or google hangouts?</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, I normally run games over Skype and Hangouts, the OP was just asking for a forum based on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T13:44:06-07:00","id":683488,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vaneheart</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/678469-looking-for-a-online-messageboard-distance-hunter-the-vigil-game-or-a-mortals-game?p=682690#post682690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I actually have quite a few additional people who are interested in doing this. What's the maximum number of people you would be comfortable with?</div> </div> </div> </div>My maximum would probably be 4-5 players. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T20:57:21-07:00","id":683862,"title":"","content":"Hmm, think we're at six total, including myself. I'll double check and see if anyone is unsure or willing to bow out. <br /> <br /> Amusingly, I had three others ask me about it today (told them we're getting large, but I'd put them on standby), so that would almost be enough for two groups. I'll have to dig around for them and see if anyone is up for a second game. I didn't think I would get this kind of turnout from my gaming crew.<br /> <br /> For the record, I once had 14 people show up to my tabletop game, and regularly had 6 or 7, so large numbers weren't a big deal to me. Four or five is the sweet spot though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/819-vaneheart","name":"Vaneheart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar819_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-01T04:03:12-07:00","id":684234,"title":"","content":"I am interested in joining this if you are accepting new players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5871-monkey-d","name":"Monkey D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5871_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-01T06:10:54-07:00","id":684349,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vaneheart</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/678469-looking-for-a-online-messageboard-distance-hunter-the-vigil-game-or-a-mortals-game?p=683862#post683862\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm, think we're at six total, including myself. I'll double check and see if anyone is unsure or willing to bow out.<br /> <br /> Amusingly, I had three others ask me about it today (told them we're getting large, but I'd put them on standby), so that would almost be enough for two groups. I'll have to dig around for them and see if anyone is up for a second game. I didn't think I would get this kind of turnout from my gaming crew.<br /> <br /> For the record, I once had 14 people show up to my tabletop game, and regularly had 6 or 7, so large numbers weren't a big deal to me. Four or five is the sweet spot though.</div> </div> </div> </div>My largest group ever was my First WoD game where I had 7-10 people, and even then I split them across multiple teams or groups similar to Game of Thrones.<br /> I could probably handle like 6-14 people if they don't mind me using that format. In general with a forum I think I could handle a large group better. With the codes on that forum, I could very easily set up 5+ replies at once, and I wouldn't expect everyone to want to stick around forever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","user":"NovaP","date":". 10-01-2015, 09:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-01T06:14:07-07:00","id":684354,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Monkey D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/678469-looking-for-a-online-messageboard-distance-hunter-the-vigil-game-or-a-mortals-game?p=684234#post684234\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am interested in joining this if you are accepting new players.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure I could say no to the future king of pirates <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. If you have a concept and register on the forum, you're pretty much in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-01T09:15:29-07:00","id":684522,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NovaP</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/678469-looking-for-a-online-messageboard-distance-hunter-the-vigil-game-or-a-mortals-game?p=683487#post683487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean, I normally run games over Skype and Hangouts, the OP was just asking for a forum based on.</div> </div> </div> </div>OP said he was open to new things too !!! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> I would be very interested in playing something in real time. I have never done a PBP because my perceptions of them is that they are too slow and nothing really gets done. I could be entirely wrong on that. I would like to do something with 4-5 people as well, anything more than that I feel like there is too much down time while people are taking their turns. I currently play table top saturday nights with 5 people and sunday afternoons on skype with 4-5 people. I do a couple of one on one games too through out the week. If you think we could do something PM me and we could exchange info. Or maybe I could watch your PBP to see if it something that would work for me?? Thanks !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2308,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","user":"Vitalis","date":". 10-01-2015, 12:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-01T11:38:09-07:00","id":684678,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vitalis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/678469-looking-for-a-online-messageboard-distance-hunter-the-vigil-game-or-a-mortals-game?p=684522#post684522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> OP said he was open to new things too !!! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I would be very interested in playing something in real time. I have never done a PBP because my perceptions of them is that they are too slow and nothing really gets done. I could be entirely wrong on that. I would like to do something with 4-5 people as well, anything more than that I feel like there is too much down time while people are taking their turns. I currently play table top saturday nights with 5 people and sunday afternoons on skype with 4-5 people. I do a couple of one on one games too through out the week. If you think we could do something PM me and we could exchange info. Or maybe I could watch your PBP to see if it something that would work for me?? Thanks !</div> </div> </div> </div>Feel free to add me on skype, my username is novakidx if you want to add me. The only problem is that even though you want to play a game, you'd have to find 3 other skype players. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-02T09:14:52-07:00","id":685840,"title":"","content":"That makes sense. Is there anyone else in this thread interested in a skype game too? Seemed like a lot were keeping an eye on it! Thanks again! I hope we can get something going. I will hit you up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-04T10:11:40-07:00","id":688474,"title":"","content":"Lemme know if there are any updates on the game. I stopped getting any.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5298-novap","name":"NovaP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T13:59:02-07:00","id":690332,"title":"","content":"Everything 